      "text": "Tech debt: Pre-existing test anti-patterns - daemon-api-projects.test.ts has 10 no-op tests behind existsSync guards. ralph.test.ts and ralph-context-refresh.test.ts have conditional assertions without preceding guard assertions. Not from ralph loop but should fix.",
