    {
      "ref": "01KHVR5K",
      "text": "Per-module task files and task archiving: Original design intent was project.tasks.yaml for non-spec tasks, <module>.tasks.yaml for module-scoped tasks. Never fully implemented — everything goes to project.tasks.yaml. Tradeoffs: splitting reduces file size (comfy-ecaj-nodes has 97 tasks in one file) but requires reading more files. Related: need task archiving to move completed tasks out of the active file. Both address the same scaling problem (task files growing unbounded) from different angles.",
      "created_at": "2026-02-19T20:06:26.877Z",
