      "text": "Single-source task state diagram: currently duplicated in AGENTS.md, templates/agents-sections/03-task-lifecycle.md, and src/cli/help/content.ts. Adding needs_work required updating all three independently. Generate from schema or single template to avoid triple-update when adding states.",
